# Online Book Store – Laravel Project

## Project Overview

This project is a simple **Online Book Store** web application developed using Laravel.

The system allows users to:

* View books
* Search books
* View book details
* Manage books through admin dashboard
* Integrate external API data

The project follows proper MVC architecture using Laravel Blade Templates and MySQL database.

---

# Technologies Used

* Laravel 11
* PHP 8+
* MySQL
* Bootstrap 5
* Blade Templates
* Google Books REST API

---

