# Installation Steps

## 1. Clone Project

```bash
https://github.com/MChandru07/Online-Book-Store.git
```

---

## 2. Open Project Folder

```bash
cd bookstore
```

---

## 3. Install Dependencies

```bash
composer install
```

---

## 4. Create Environment File

```bash
cp .env.example .env
```

---

## 5. Generate Application Key

```bash
php artisan key:generate
```

---

# Database Setup

## Create Database

Open MySQL and create database:

```sql
CREATE DATABASE bookstore;
```

---

## Configure .env File

```env
DB_CONNECTION=mysql
DB_HOST=127.0.0.1
DB_PORT=3306
DB_DATABASE=bookstore
DB_USERNAME=root
DB_PASSWORD=
```

---

## Run Migration

```bash
php artisan migrate
```

---

# Run Laravel Project

```bash
php artisan serve
```

Open browser:

```text
http://127.0.0.1:8000
```

---

# API Integration

This project uses Google Books API.

Example API:

```text
https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes?q=laravel
```

Laravel API Call Example:

```php
use Illuminate\Support\Facades\Http;

$response = Http::get(
    'https://www.googleapis.com/books/v1/volumes?q=laravel'
);

$data = $response->json();
```
